"One-electron properties can be computed if an ``EXPEC`` directive follows "
"the ``DF-MP2-F12``, ``DF-CCSD``, or ``DF-CCSD(T)`` cards (the ``GEXPEC`` "
"directive has no effect in this case). Properties are obtained as analytical"
" energy derivatives with or without taking into account the orbital "
"relaxation, which can be specified as"
msgstr ""
"如果在 ``DF-MP2-F12``\\ 、\\ ``DF-CCSD`` 或 ``DF-CCSD(T)`` 卡片后跟随一个 ``EXPEC`` "
"指令（此时 ``GEXPEC`` 指令无效），则可以计算单电子性质。这些性质作为解析能量导数获得，可以选择是否考虑轨道弛豫，具体可通过以下方式指定："

msgid ""
"Note also that calculations including CABS singles corrections must be done "
"by adding the CABS singles contribution computed separately. The syntax for "
"operators *opname* is explained in section `One-electron operators and "
